      "value": "@{59d8aba4cd40ec1433de99bb|full_name}: let me share more points then.\nyou can if your walking and someone drops a portal, either you was turning the corner and you ended up in it or they droped it right in front of you either accidentally or not when you was walking/running giving you no time to react because the collider of the portal spawns before the portal dose and the portal's collider is bigger then the portal itself, theirs the trolls who will drop portals in angles that are in/on sharp turns or stairs that the very tip of the portals collider is at a spot that your player collider clips it and sends you though it, true you have to be holding W or going in the angle that moves you forewords in vr, but you can still enter the portal if any of the angles of the front 180 of you is the direction your going, and in vr moving your head at those angles can send you in, then you got the hackers that could either spawn a portal at any X:Y:Z in the map and will drop it right inside of you or just in front of you that you could psychically lean ever so slightly and because its inside of you, you enter it because moving your head in vr is going to tell the game that you was moving in that direction thus triggering the portals collider thus sending you in, the portal collider spawns in 1st then the portal itself, the portals collider is also bigger then the portal so you could have the collider of the portal clipping the very tip of a doorway or corner or stairs that you can not see and can end up entering, people normally have the \"Skip go button\" enabled so when you enter a portal it will automatically send you right into a world, if you have that and say a troll or hacker gets you then the world you enter could have alot of demanding stuff spawn in at one time freezing/crashing your game or if demanding enough freezing/crashing your pc, it could have the loudest noise play making you go deaf or your ears ringing or blowing your speakers/headphones, it could also have spastic lights and stuff it could have all the above, and you entered it because the collider spawns before the portal, or your player collider cliped the portal's collider while going up/down those stairs or around the corner or you leaning your head as it was droped inside of or in front of you.",
