  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There should be an option in the menu that you're able to mark or unmarked the ability of portal colliders an example, you're in a public world and you see a random stranger place a portal, you don't want to accidentally run into said portal so option is to have in your settings \"allow non-friend portal colliders\" or something of that nature of name in that sort of function where you're only able to go through portals that your friends placed or you can disabled that option so you can go through anyone's portals that they place, this would help deflect portal Trappers, trolls and that area, so it's a bit more safer to walk around in a Lobby your in and not accidentally end up in a portal that just popped up in front of you, I think this sort of functionality should and would most definitely be really useful and helpful to everyone.",
